flowchart TD
    LAST[最终第39层 HC + pre_mix] --> AG[原 full HC AG + pre_mix AG]
    AG --> COPY[DSpark MTP bank copy：无当前读者]
    AG --> COLL[原 full-M FP32 multiply/reduce → BF16]
    COPY -. 保持其它数学操作不变可删 .-> CAP[每卡320 MiB逻辑容量；native资格待验]
    COLL --> RMS[原 full-M RMS]
    RMS --> SEL[ordered logits_indices：全部验证项 + bonus]
    RMS --> PROMPT{prompt logprobs / pooling / PP等}
    PROMPT --> FULL[额外完整行读者或原路径 fallback]
    SEL --> HEAD[target BF16 head + TP8 gather]
    HEAD --> PROC[constraints / processors / greedy或random]
    PROC --> REJECT[实际 reject kernel → -1后缀的输出ID]
    REJECT --> SEED[count / last seed]
    REJECT --> D2H[独立stream D2H + copy event + 持有设备引用]
    AUX[层36/37/38入口 aux] --> DRAFT[DSpark main/context/3 decoder/5 Markov]
    SEED --> DRAFT
    DRAFT --> DID[草稿ID + 原K stride]
    D2H --> THREAD[Worker输出线程 get_output → Core FIFO drain]
    THREAD --> SCHED[scheduler 拒绝回退 / stop trim / stale代次]
    SCHED --> CLIENT[detokenize / earliest stop-string / holdback / 输出queue]
    CLIENT -->|字符串stop发abort| SCHED
    SCHED --> NEXTMAP[下一轮req-ID映射与scheduled draft长度]
    NEXTMAP --> SNAP[先snapshot旧computed/count/drafts 再原地更新]
    SEED --> SNAP
    SNAP --> POS[校正GPU positions / seq_lens / slot]
    NEXTMAP --> IDS[bonus + 草稿prefix scatter / 新prefill CPU输入]
    DID --> IDS
    SEED --> IDS
    POS --> INPUT[下一轮输入 / cache与Engram metadata]
    IDS --> INPUT
    SCHED --> RETIRE[connector/EC延迟释放与代次；provider内部仍待扫]
    DRAFT --> FINALIZE[原finalize KV：wait_for_save + clear]
